{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677860/extras/6c68e633c55cab42bd2c8f9662d8aaee.poster.avif?t=1774120406\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677860/extras/6c68e633c55cab42bd2c8f9662d8aaee.webm?t=1774120406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677860/extras/6c68e633c55cab42bd2c8f9662d8aaee.mp4?t=1774120406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Nearly destroyed, a delicate but highly advanced robot awakens to a city in crisis. A dominating robotics manufacturer has disappeared in the midst of addressing a dangerous malfunction in their models.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">What caused all this destruction? And can it be stopped?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>What will you become to find out?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique movement mechanics allow a broken city to become your playground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of your small size and parasitic abilities to get the upper hand on challenging enemy encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve innovative puzzles by redirecting power sources and manipulating the abilities of different robots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear your way across diverse levels ranging from deserted industrial sites to luxury office complexes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677860/extras/f639826574922f592649e2e7aed848f6.poster.avif?t=1774120406\" width=600 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677860/extras/f639826574922f592649e2e7aed848f6.webm?t=1774120406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677860/extras/f639826574922f592649e2e7aed848f6.mp4?t=1774120406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\t<strong>CAUTION!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Robots hate bugs. They will not hesitate to crush, burn, shock, soak, or otherwise destroy them on sight.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"party_crashlog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3677860/6fc2cc302d7fad605d48ec082311ec6f501d11fe.jpg"},{"name":"Top of the Heap","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3677860/fa3fe869b65f6d282b8c4dd8a6b3e572acdb4465.jpg"},{"name":"Robot Food","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3677860/ca43d3c7835c86c8c3df569e6424b491d34d8b24.jpg"},{"name":"Patch Notes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3677860/519ef66a2c879db321c6d46f49a250afa5d3a6c4.jpg"},{"name":"Efficient Debugging","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3677860/ef3ed66e916d48bb15e7bfbf482cf4150a455241.jpg"},{"name":"Compassionate Computing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3677860/0490a1980123a606aa3256e69934bd9d6ad47c2f.jpg"},{"name":"Public Key","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3677860/2c6752b76de32f5f4b7e864b327f68ae8f63ee69.jpg"},{"name":"C4N1N3 Case Study","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steam